00:02:22.179 --> 00:02:25.512
Observation of the setting, the context.

00:02:27.524 --> 00:02:28.925
Where am I right now?

00:02:28.925 --> 00:02:31.244
What's the color of the walls?

00:02:31.244 --> 00:02:32.696
What's it smell like here?

00:02:32.696 --> 00:02:34.425
What's it feel like here?

00:02:34.425 --> 00:02:36.194
What's this environment?

00:02:36.194 --> 00:02:38.715
Human beings, we do have
