you have insane talent.

00:11:15.084 --> 00:11:17.902
Because you have these ideas,
and you have an ability,

00:11:17.902 --> 00:11:18.735
and you want to do something good,

00:11:18.735 --> 00:11:19.839
and you want to have a big impact,

00:11:19.839 --> 00:11:21.231
and you're sitting on it.

00:11:21.231 --> 00:11:23.931
You're wasting your time,
you're checking your Facebook

00:11:23.931 --> 00:11:24.949
and doing all these other things that

00:11:24.949 --> 00:11:27.109
are getting in the way of
you doing something great.

00:11:27.109 --> 00:11:28.520
Stop playing small.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.098
So I'd like you to make a commitment.

00:11:30.098 --> 00:11:31.541
I want you to make a commitment.

00:11:31.541 --> 00:11:35.933
I want you to say to yourself
I'm going to stop playing small

00:11:35.933 --> 00:11:37.962
and start being present.

00:11:37.962 --> 00:11:42.810
I'm going to stop playing
small and start being present.

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:46.977
I'm going to stop playing
small and start being present!

00:11:48.484 --> 00:11:49.317
Do that for the next 30 days and

00:11:49.317 --> 00:11:51.132
the results will astound you.

00:11:51.132 --> 00:11:53.563
Finally you'll be playing at a level

00:11:53.563 --> 00:11:55.072
that you're capable of.

00:11:55.072 --> 00:11:57.612
You'll be doing things
that you know you could do,

00:11:57.612 --> 00:11:58.730
but never actually reached.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.831
Stop playing small, start being present.

00:12:01.831 --> 00:12:02.664
Believe.

00:12:02.664 --> 00:12:05.762
(light drumming)

00:12:05.762 --> 00:12:06.720
So thank you guys so much for watching.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.643
I made this video because
my (mumbles) asked me to,

00:12:09.643 --> 00:12:11.103
so if there's a topic
you'd like me to cover

00:12:11.103 --> 00:12:12.891
in the next edition of Believe Life,

00:12:12.891 --> 00:12:15.742
leave it in the comments below
and I'll see what I can do.

00:12:15.742 --> 00:12:18.919
I'm also curious what point
did you learn from this,

00:12:18.919 --> 00:12:20.461
that you're really going to take home

00:12:20.461 --> 00:12:22.939
and apply to your life or to your business

00:12:22.939 --> 00:12:26.039
to help you stay more present?

00:12:26.039 --> 00:12:28.704
Leave it in the comments,
I'm curious to find out.

00:12:28.704 --> 00:12:31.023
Finally, I want to give a quick
shout out to Roberto Blake.

00:12:31.023 --> 00:12:33.989
Roberto, thank you so much
for, one, being in my book.

00:12:33.989 --> 00:12:37.580
Your One Word is one of the
stories that I told in the book,

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.378
I appreciate you sharing
your awesome story,

00:12:40.378 --> 00:12:43.099
but also for recently making
a video of you with the book,

00:12:43.099 --> 00:12:44.260
and sharing it with your audience.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.718
I really, really, really
appreciate it, man.

00:12:46.718 --> 00:12:49.879
- First of all, I'm in
the book Your One Word

00:12:49.879 --> 00:12:51.319
by my good friend Evan Carmichael.

00:12:51.319 --> 00:12:52.778
You guys probably know who Evan is

00:12:52.778 --> 00:12:54.049
if you're watching this channel.

00:12:54.049 --> 00:12:56.954
He has one of the best
channels for entrepreneurship

00:12:56.954 --> 00:12:58.957
and motivation out there.

00:12:58.957 --> 00:13:00.660
- So thank you guys again for watching.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:03.708
I believe in you, I hope you
continue to believe in yourself

00:13:03.708 --> 00:13:05.817
and whatever your one word is.

00:13:05.817 --> 00:13:09.063
Much love, we'll see you soon.

00:13:09.063 --> 00:13:11.980
(intense drumming)

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:16.720
- I don't like to think too far ahead.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:17.739
- [Interviewer] So you haven't
thought alternate careers?

00:13:17.739 --> 00:13:19.187
- No, I don't like thinking too far ahead.

00:13:19.187 --> 00:13:22.478
People set like goals, long
distance goals and (beep),

00:13:22.478 --> 00:13:23.757
that's too much for me.

00:13:23.757 --> 00:13:26.235
I all ready feel like I'm living,

00:13:26.235 --> 00:13:27.358
and then I just carry on day on day.

00:13:27.358 --> 00:13:29.665
And I'll carry on day
by day, all ready living

00:13:29.665 --> 00:13:32.485
the final goal, the goal of
being the world champion.

00:13:32.485 --> 00:13:34.193
I all ready carry myself
like I'm the world champion,

00:13:34.193 --> 00:13:36.086
I all ready speak like
I'm a world champion.

00:13:36.086 --> 00:13:39.415
And that's it, I just carry on day by day.

00:13:39.415 --> 00:13:40.997
So I'll take it as it comes.

00:13:40.997 --> 00:13:44.274
Again, like I said, you were
asking me about the future,

00:13:44.274 --> 00:13:46.724
I'll let you know a little bit closer.

00:13:46.724 --> 00:13:47.557
You know what I mean?

00:13:47.557 --> 00:13:51.077
All I can see right now is the
goal, that's all I can see.

00:13:51.077 --> 00:13:53.469
- If you're an Olympic athlete
or something like that,

00:13:53.469 --> 00:13:56.481
you get to the high, you
also have to peak at the time

00:13:56.481 --> 00:13:58.162
it's an Olympic year.

00:13:58.162 --> 00:13:59.517
You could be the fastest
runner in the world

00:13:59.517 --> 00:14:01.438
and it's an off year.

00:14:01.438 --> 00:14:04.027
And so you know, by the
time you get to the Olympics

00:14:04.027 --> 00:14:05.697
three years later, you aren't anymore.

00:14:05.697 --> 00:14:08.805
So there's a lot of luck
involved in things in the world.

00:14:08.805 --> 00:14:11.502
I've never lived my life
thinking about my next job

00:14:11.502 --> 00:14:13.449
because I was always in
the last job I could have

00:14:13.449 --> 00:14:15.440
as far as I could tell.

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.853
And I think it's a huge
advantage for you to live

00:14:18.853 --> 00:14:22.183
in the moment and not
to be seething too much.

00:14:22.183 --> 00:14:23.225
I mean, obviously, you plan,

00:14:23.225 --> 00:14:25.764
even though your plans never work out,

00:14:25.764 --> 00:14:30.066
but if you want, the
secret is to do a great job

00:14:30.066 --> 00:14:32.284
with what you're doing.

00:14:32.284 --> 00:14:34.898
What you should do is
you should perform as if

00:14:34.898 --> 00:14:37.786
you were in your next
job, but not seethe with

00:14:37.786 --> 00:14:40.816
the ambition to get
there, and project that.

00:14:40.816 --> 00:14:42.267
You'll make people nervous as hell,

00:14:42.267 --> 00:14:44.350
and you'll kill yourself.

00:14:45.478 --> 00:14:47.645
When I was in high school,

00:14:48.776 --> 00:14:51.550
because you've heard all
those advise reports.

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:54.148
I went Harvard College
at Harvard Law School.

00:14:54.148 --> 00:14:58.315
When I went to the college from
the high school I came from,

00:14:59.354 --> 00:15:02.177
it never dawned on me
that I'd get into that

00:15:02.177 --> 00:15:04.759
kind of an Ivy League,
it just didn't happen,

00:15:04.759 --> 00:15:08.166
but I applied, and I never
thought about it after really

00:15:08.166 --> 00:15:12.064
I applied because it
just wasn't on my scope.

00:15:12.064 --> 00:15:15.002
And so when I got a letter I got...

00:15:15.002 --> 00:15:17.085
It didn't have any anxiety to it,

00:15:17.085 --> 00:15:20.542
and when I got that letter
I just was like ecstatic.

00:15:20.542 --> 00:15:21.462
And then my mind opened up.

00:15:21.462 --> 00:15:22.814
But it was just like a great,

00:15:22.814 --> 00:15:25.363
even the process of that was great.

00:15:25.363 --> 00:15:29.530
When I was in college, and
I applied to Law School,

00:15:30.854 --> 00:15:32.724
I went down to the mailbox everyday.

00:15:32.724 --> 00:15:35.401
I knew the consequences of it,
I was with a bunch of people

00:15:35.401 --> 00:15:36.983
who also wanted, and we're vying for it.

00:15:36.983 --> 00:15:40.042
And I was like torturing myself over,

00:15:40.042 --> 00:15:41.293
and I was imagining what if I do get it,

00:15:41.293 --> 00:15:42.180
what if I don't get it,

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.150
what are the consequences
of getting it or not.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:48.072
And I tell you, you know,
it effected my life,

00:15:48.072 --> 00:15:52.006
it effected, you know, the functionality.

00:15:52.006 --> 00:15:52.985
That's a difference.

00:15:52.985 --> 00:15:57.205
If you could approach every
opportunity like I did

00:15:57.205 --> 00:16:01.646
the college one, you'll be
better and you'll be happier.

00:16:01.646 --> 00:16:04.774
And if you live the life
tormented about what

00:16:04.774 --> 00:16:07.055
are my prospects or the next one,

00:16:07.055 --> 00:16:10.513
when life is random and
there's some chance involved in

00:16:10.513 --> 00:16:14.063
things, you're going to be tortured.

00:16:14.063 --> 00:16:18.230
- I've had seasons where I've
had the worst surgeries ever.

00:16:20.315 --> 00:16:24.360
I've been through, I've
had seven surgeries,

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:27.542
and that alone, you know, you
ask yourself time and time

00:16:27.542 --> 00:16:30.102
again, how do you bounce back from that,

00:16:30.102 --> 00:16:31.254
year end and year out.

00:16:31.254 --> 00:16:34.255
But I've always used it
as taking that time to

00:16:34.255 --> 00:16:38.023
strengthen myself, I never knew
I was going to play 17 years.

00:16:38.023 --> 00:16:40.415
Who could've ever thought that?

00:16:40.415 --> 00:16:42.424
When you come into the
league you don't say,

00:16:42.424 --> 00:16:43.451
you know what, I'm going to play 17 years.

00:16:43.451 --> 00:16:44.603
And you don't even think of it that way,

00:16:44.603 --> 00:16:46.803
you just say I'll take it year by year.

00:16:46.803 --> 00:16:49.221
And that's what I try to tell kids,

00:16:49.221 --> 00:16:51.311
don't move to next year too fast.

00:16:51.311 --> 00:16:53.369
Just like don't go to tomorrow too fast,

00:16:53.369 --> 00:16:55.218
deal with today, deal with right now.

00:16:55.218 --> 00:16:57.699
We've been in the locker
room and we have practice,

00:16:57.699 --> 00:16:59.720
and I'm like listen, put the phones down,

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.470
because these moments
going to go too fast.

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.930
And when they're gone, they're gone.

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.620
So before you look up,
you're in two, three, five,

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.581
seven, 10, 12, if you make it that long.

00:17:08.581 --> 00:17:10.477
Because most of them don't.

00:17:10.477 --> 00:17:11.829
Just like you spoke about earlier,

00:17:11.829 --> 00:17:14.647
most of these young babies
never see five years,

00:17:14.647 --> 00:17:18.409
never see seven years,
nevertheless a 10 year career.

00:17:18.409 --> 00:17:21.608
You try to prepare them to
understand what the moment

00:17:21.608 --> 00:17:23.769
actually feels like,
and that's why I think,

00:17:23.769 --> 00:17:25.788
honestly, why my career lasted so long,

00:17:25.788 --> 00:17:27.610
because I always lived in the moment.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:31.720
Nothing else mattered to me,
and I was selfish at times,

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:35.118
even towards my family,
nothing else mattered

00:17:35.118 --> 00:17:36.799
when it came to that.

00:17:36.799 --> 00:17:38.789
When it came to that I was dialed in.

00:17:38.789 --> 00:17:42.289
It's a heck of a blessing to be here, now,

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.453
I'm walking, I'm healthy.

00:17:47.109 --> 00:17:48.098
- Still making an impact?

00:17:48.098 --> 00:17:51.098
- Absolutely, so I just tell people,

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.139
I don't know how long,
whoever's going to play,

00:17:55.139 --> 00:17:57.258
but I will say enjoy every moment.

00:17:57.258 --> 00:18:00.099
Don't rush too fast,
take care of your years,

00:18:00.099 --> 00:18:02.761
but go year by year, go day
by day, go hour by hour,

00:18:02.761 --> 00:18:03.834
go minute by minute.

